---
title: "liquidate_adl_deposit (Pebble Protocol: Auto-Deleverage)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_pre_check: pre_liquidation_check(app, cap, market, adl_perm)
    q_pre_check --> q_timestamp: now = clock.timestamp_ms() / 1000
    q_timestamp --> q_get_repay: repay_amount = available_repay_coin.value()
    q_get_repay --> q_handle_adl: handle_collateral_auto_deleverage(obligation_id, coin, registry, oracle, clock, now, ctx)
    q_handle_adl --> q_post_liq: post_liquidation(now, repay_amount, ADLCollateral, ...)
    q_post_liq --> q_transfer: transfer collateral and refund to sender
    q_transfer --> [*]: return

    note right of q_handle_adl
        INV-001: ADL collateral deleverage must be enabled for collateral type
        INV-002: total deposit must breach target_amount (limit must be breached)
        INV-003: activation timestamp must have passed
        INV-004: collateral must have can_be_collateral = true
        INV-005: liquidation_ltv decreases hourly
        INV-006: liquidation_incentive increases daily (penalty)
        INV-007: ADL incentive capped by normal liquidation_incentive
    end note
